Chapter: CvmmState
  cites Cvmm chapter CvmmTypes
  cites Cvmm chapter Command
  cites Cvmm chapter Keybindings
  cites Foreword chapter Maybe

 Global application state for the CVMM shell. Tracks which view is
 active, the notification queue, system-wide summary stats, and the
 navigation history. Every manager reads its slice; the shell owns
 the top-level state and dispatches actions.

Section: Navigation

  ViewId =
    | ViewDashboard
    | ViewFileExplorer
    | ViewDriveManager
    | ViewUsbManager
    | ViewProcessManager
    | ViewServiceManager
    | ViewPortMonitor
    | ViewNetworkManager
    | ViewDisplayManager
    | ViewServerManager
    | ViewFleetManager
    | ViewDeployManager
    | ViewLogViewer
    | ViewTerminal
    | ViewMonitor
    | ViewMesh
    | ViewSettings
    | ViewCalendar
    | ViewNotes
    | ViewAudio
    | ViewNotifications
    | ViewScreenSaver
    | ViewPower
    | ViewDateTime
    | ViewBluetooth
    | ViewPrivacy
    | ViewDefaultApps
    | ViewWallpaper
    | ViewKeyboardRgb

  view-id-label : ViewId -> Text
